      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/301702404/3017024040020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、あさひ早かったな\r\n悪い、待たせて。何やってたんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 3017024040030,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "マグネットネイルっす！\r\n磁石で絵が描けるんすよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301702404/3017024040030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうなのか、すごいな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 3017024040040,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんの爪にも\r\n描いていいっすか？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301702404/3017024040040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ！？　俺？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 3017024040050,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "だめっすか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301702404/3017024040050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ……いや……まあ……\r\nあさひがやりたいなら……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 3017024040060,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "いいってことっすか？\r\nありがとっす～",
