  {
    "id": 3017024040100,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "……この前の撮影\r\n最初はよくわかんなかったっす",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301702404/3017024040100"
  },
  {
    "id": 3017024040110,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "『可愛い』と『クール』、反対のものは\r\nくっつかないのに、どうしてって思ったっす",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301702404/3017024040110"
  },
  {
    "id": 3017024040120,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "でも、コスメのイベントで\r\nマグネットネイルを見て気づいたんす",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301702404/3017024040120"
  },
  {
    "id": 3017024040130,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "磁石は反対同士じゃなきゃくっつかないんすよ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301702404/3017024040130"
  },
  {
    "id": 3017024040140,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "世の中には反対だからくっつかないものも\r\n反対だからくっつくものも両方あるんす",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301702404/3017024040140"
  },
  {
    "id": 3017024040150,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "そうしたら、『どうして』がなくなって\r\n上手くできた気がするんすよ",
    "charAnim1": "think1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301702404/3017024040150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほどな……\r\nだから磁石って言ってたのか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（そこから発想できるあさひはすごいけど、\r\n今回の撮影で何かを得られたならよかったな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
